  "prefLabel": "Puc 202.06 Declaratory ruling",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 202.06 “Declaratory ruling” means a commission ruling as to the applicability of any statutory provision or of any rule or order of the commission.\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25",
